# Lanes write throwaway scripts here: several specs name this directory by absolute path,
# because `write_file` is a tool and expands no variables, and a lane's own clone must stay
# clean for its `git status --porcelain` acceptance check. This directory resolves inside the
# planning worktree, so without this a lane's scratch file would sit here as untracked and
# could be swept into a commit. Ignore everything; the planning notes below stay tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!loops-design.md
!queue_lines.txt
!split-brief.md
